    {
      "id": 19,
      "start": 78.889,
      "end": 85.26,
      "label": "mandarin",
      "text": "右腿弯曲，施救者双手分别放到触电者的右肩和右前膝盖，",
      "score": 0.4168,
      "wav": "",
      "signals": {
        "mand_logprob": -0.1634,
        "sc_logprob": -0.1691,
        "sc_delta": -0.0057,
        "acoustic_dev": 0.618,
        "seg_cer": 0.208,
        "lang_free": "Chinese",
        "phon_confuse": 0.0,
        "phon_examples": "",
        "lexicon": "",
        "text_free": "右腿弯曲，施救者双手分别放到足垫这里，右肩和右膝盖。"
